    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which of the following correctly pairs the area with its region type?\n\nOptions: \nA. The South and formal region\nB. Canada and formal region\nC. Atlanta metropolitan area and vernacular region\nD. The South and functional region\nE. Canada and functional region\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
