    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which of the following best exemplifies the process of contagious diffusion?\n\nOptions: \nA. The loss of parts of one’s native culture after migration\nB. A new video spreading rapidly online\nC. The growing popularity of American-style pizza\nD. The spread of rap music\nE. The adoption of customs from a different culture\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
