      "generated_answer": "To determine who earns the most, we convert each person's hourly wage into US dollars (USD) and then calculate their total earnings for an eight-hour day.\n\n1.  **Navin (Mauritius):** Hourly wage = $160 / 32.35 \\approx 4.9459$ USD. Total for 8 hours = $4.9459 \\times 8 \\approx 39.57$ USD.\n2.  **Luka (Croatia):** Hourly wage = $25 / 5.18 \\approx 4.8263$ USD. Total for 8 hours = $4.8263 \\times 8 \\approx 38.61$ USD.\n3.  **Ian (Botswana):** Hourly wage = $34 / 6.95 \\approx 4.8921$ USD. Total for 8 hours = $4.8921 \\times 8 \\approx 39.14$ USD.\n\nComparing the daily totals, Navin earns the most.\n\n\\boxed{Navin}",
