    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In most ecosystems, net primary productivity is important because it represents the\n\nOptions: \nA. biomass of all producers\nB. biomass of all consumers\nC. energy available to heterotrophs\nD. energy consumed by decomposers\nE. total solar energy converted to chemical energy by producers\nF. energy available to producers\nG. energy available to autotrophs\nH. total energy lost during energy transfer between trophic levels\nI. total energy produced by autotrophs and heterotrophs combined\nJ. energy stored in the soil\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
