    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "In biology and psychology, behavior is recognized as the result of a complex interaction between genetic predisposition (nature) and environmental influences (nurture). While some behaviors are innate (inherited), many can be modified through learning and experience throughout an individual's life. Therefore, both inheritance and learning are essential components in shaping how an organism behaves.\n\n\\boxed{I}",
