    "global index": "MMLUPro_chemistry_3447",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Examining data obtained from mass spectrometry supports which of the following?\n\nOptions: \nA. The smell of elements\nB. The common oxidation states of elements\nC. The feel of elements\nD. The temperature at which elements melt\nE. Ionization energy trends within the periodic table\nF. The color of elements\nG. The sound produced when elements react\nH. Atomic size trends within the periodic table\nI. The taste of elements\nJ. The existence of isotopes\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
