    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The probability that a point (x, y) in R^2 is chosen follows a uniform random distribution within the region described by the inequality 0 < |x| + |y| < 1 . What is the probability that 2(x + y) > 1?\n\nOptions: \nA. 1/3\nB. sqrt(2)/8\nC. 2/3\nD. 1/sqrt(2)\nE. 3/4\nF. sqrt(2)/4\nG. 1/2\nH. 1/8\nI. 1/4\nJ. 0\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
