    "global index": "MMLUPro_math_6714",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: matrix $A=(\\begin{{array}}{{rrrr}} -2 & -1 & -1 & -1 \\ 2 & 1 & 3 & 2 \\ 1 & 1 & 0 & 1 \\ -1 & -1 & -2 & -2 \\end{{array}})$. Suppose f is the minimal polynomial of A. What is f(99)? Return the numeric without explanation.\n\nOptions: \nA. 1000000.0\nB. 1010000.0\nC. 980000.0\nD. 100000.0\nE. 989000.0\nF. 990100.0\nG. 980001.0\nH. 980100.0\nI. 990000.0\nJ. 999000.0\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
