    "global index": "MathQA_167",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: the average salary of the employees in a office is rs . 120 / month . the avg salary of officers is rs . 460 and of non officers is rs 110 . if the no . of officers is 15 , then find the no of nonofficers in the office .\n\nOptions: \nA. 400\nB. 420\nC. 430\nD. 450\nE. 510\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
