    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: a bag contains 7 green and 8 white balls . if two balls are drawn simultaneously , the probability that both are of the same colour is - .\n\nOptions: \nA. 7 / 18\nB. 7 / 19\nC. 7 / 11\nD. 7 / 12\nE. 7 / 15\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "gemini-3-flash-preview",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "To find the probability that both balls are of the same color, we calculate the number of ways to pick two green balls or two white balls and divide it by the total number of ways to pick any two balls.\n\n1.  **Total ways to draw 2 balls from 15:** $\\binom{15}{2} = \\frac{15 \\times 14}{2 \\times 1} = 105$.\n2.  **Ways to draw 2 green balls:** $\\binom{7}{2} = \\frac{7 \\times 6}{2 \\times 1} = 21$.\n3.  **Ways to draw 2 white balls:** $\\binom{8}{2} = \\frac{8 \\times 7}{2 \\times 1} = 28$.\n4.  **Probability:** $\\frac{21 + 28}{105} = \\frac{49}{105} = \\frac{7}{15}$.\n\n\\boxed{E}",
      "success": true,
