    "global index": "MMLUPro_engineering_10703",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: What is the impedance of a circuit if 100\\angle0° V causes a current7.07 + j7.07 A?\n\nOptions: \nA. 6.5 - j2.3 Ω\nB. 10 - j35 Ω\nC. 8.2 - j5.7 Ω\nD. 12.1 + j3.5 Ω\nE. 7.07 + j7.07 Ω\nF. 14 + j14 Ω\nG. 0 - j14 Ω\nH. 7.07 - j7.07 Ω\nI. 5 - j10 Ω\nJ. 10 - j7 Ω\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
