  {
    "global index": "MMLUPro_engineering_10648",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Consider a carrier m(t) = n(t) \\bulletcos(\\omega_ot+ \\texttheta), amplitude modulated by the noise n(t), where \\texttheta is a random variable with a probability density f(\\texttheta) = {{1 / 2\\pi}}- \\pi \\leq \\texttheta \\leq \\pi and = 0elsewhere. If E[n^2(t)] = \\sigma^2 and \\texttheta and n(t) are independent, determine the power dissipated by m(t).\n\nOptions: \nA. (1/3)σ^2\nB. σ^2/π\nC. σ^4\nD. πσ^2\nE. (1/4)σ^2\nF. 2σ^2\nG. (3/4)σ^2\nH. (2/3)σ^2\nI. (1/2)σ^2\nJ. σ^2\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
