    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which of the following releases most energy when completely oxidised in the body?\n\nOptions: \nA. One gram of glycerol\nB. One gram of lactose\nC. One gram of fructose\nD. One gram of palmitic acid\nE. One gram of cellulose\nF. One gram of glucose\nG. One gram of alcohol\nH. One gram of leucine\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
