      "generated_answer": "The most likely correct answer is **H**.\n\nThe patient is experiencing sleep fragmentation and early awakening, which is likely exacerbated by his nightly alcoholic beverage. While alcohol can shorten the time it takes to fall asleep, its metabolism leads to a \"rebound\" effect that disrupts sleep architecture and causes mid-night or early morning awakenings. Discontinuing the alcohol is the first-line behavioral intervention for improving his sleep hygiene.\n\n\\boxed{H}",
