    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The number of patients required in a clinical trial to treat a specify disease increases as\n\nOptions: \nA. The drop-out rate increases\nB. The significance level increases\nC. The size of the expected treatment effect increased\nD. The incidence of the disease decreases\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
