      "generated_answer": "Based on the provided context, clinical guidelines and experts emphasize that irritable bowel syndrome (IBS) is a positive diagnosis based on the Rome criteria rather than a diagnosis of exclusion. The text highlights that while many community providers still treat it as such, experts and guidelines encourage making a direct diagnosis to avoid unnecessary testing.\n\n\\boxed{B}",
