      "generated_answer": "According to the text, after Chris devotes himself to his studies following Hathaway's threat to fail him, he achieves a **perfect score** on the final exam. The context further confirms this by stating that he \"aces Hathaway's exam.\"\n\n\\boxed{A perfect score}",
