      "generated_answer": "Based on the text, Mr. Jeremy Fisher's fishing rod is made from a **tough stalk of grass**. His fishing line consists of a **fine long white horse-hair** with a little wriggling worm tied at the end.\n\n\\boxed{A tough stalk of grass (rod) and a fine long white horse-hair (line).}",
