      "generated_answer": "The island was purchased by William W. Kolderup, a wealthy San Franciscan, during a government auction. He outbid his rival, J. R. Taskinar, to acquire the property. The total purchase price for Spencer Island was four million dollars.\n\n\\boxed{four million dollars}",
