      "generated_answer": "According to the context, Maskull accepts the invitation to travel to Tormance because he is a man longing for adventures. He receives this invitation from Krag, an acquaintance of his friend Nightspore, following a seance.\n\n\\boxed{He accepts the invitation because he is a man longing for adventures.}",
