      "generated_answer": "The mouse escapes by taking advantage of a hole in the duster that Miss Moppet used to tie him up. While she was tossing the bundle around like a ball, the mouse managed to wriggle out through the opening. When Miss Moppet eventually untied the duster, the mouse had already run away to the top of the cupboard.\n\n\\boxed{The mouse wriggles out through a hole in the duster while Miss Moppet is tossing him around.}",
