      "generated_answer": "Based on the provided text, it is not mentioned what the princess uses her influence to do, as the excerpt ends before the princess is introduced or takes action. The context describes the king's system of \"poetic justice\" in the arena and the two possible outcomes for an accused person: being killed by a tiger or married to a lady. The narrative stops during the description of the marriage ceremony and transitions into Project Gutenberg licensing information.\n\n\\boxed{The provided text does not contain information about the princess or how she uses her influence.}",
