Literary\nArchive Foundation, how to help produce our new eBooks, and how to\nsubscribe to our email newsletter to hear about new eBooks.\n\n\nQuestion: What causes Jeremy to cut his fingers while fishing?\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format. Keep your explanation clear, concise, and within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "gemini-3-flash-preview",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "While fishing, Mr. Jeremy Fisher catches a stickleback named Jack Sharp instead of a minnow. The stickleback is covered in spines and pricks Mr. Jeremy as it flounders about the boat. Consequently, Mr. Jeremy is left sucking his sore fingers after the fish jumps back into the water.\n\n\\boxed{The spines of a stickleback fish named Jack Sharp.}",
